# Accounts page. Never sign in or type a real key.
ipc panels settings accounts
wait 2
shot acc-top
note A1 headings "Google", "iCloud", "Microsoft 365" in that order, each part's groups as the QML, same heading size and weight (check in each look).
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 20
wait 1
shot acc-mid
note A1 middle of the page: iCloud part as QML.
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 40
wait 1
shot acc-end
note A1 end of the page: Microsoft 365 part as QML.
ipc panels settings google
wait 2
shot acc-google
note A2 Accounts opens scrolled so that the Google heading is at the top, both shells.
ipc panels settings icloud
wait 2
shot acc-icloud
note A2 iCloud heading at the top.
ipc panels settings microsoft
wait 2
shot acc-microsoft
note A2 Microsoft 365 heading at the top.
# MANUAL: A3 in the Google part open More options, switch "Use your own OAuth client" on, go to another page and back: QML has More options closed and the switch off again (batch 3: typed state starts over); Rust must match
ipc panels close
